    "Free supports general behavioral structure; Pro is for repeatable guidance tailored to a target role or company loop.": "Libre apoya la estructura conductual general; Pro es para una orientación repetible adaptada a un rol objetivo o ciclo de la empresa.",
    "Free to start. Pro from $6.99/month, $79/year, or $149 lifetime.": "Gratis para empezar. Pro de $6.99/month, $79/year o $149 de por vida.",
    "Free trial; $99.99 monthly; $69.99 quarterly monthly price; $29.99 yearly monthly price; $699.99 lifetime": "Prueba gratuita; $99.99 mensual; $69.99 precio mensual trimestral; $29.99 precio mensual anual; $699.99 de por vida",
    "Free trial; Monthly $99.99; Quarterly $69.99 monthly price billed quarterly; Yearly $29.99 monthly price billed yearly; Lifetime $699.99.": "Prueba gratuita; Mensual $99.99; Trimestral $69.99 precio mensual facturado trimestralmente; Anual $29.99 precio mensual facturado anualmente; De por vida $699.99.",
