    "Ask for STAR structure, sharper transitions, and follow-up questions without inventing details.": "询问 STAR 结构、更清晰的过渡以及后续问题，而无需发明细节。",
    "Ask for structure, clarification, notes, review, and tradeoffs instead of using assistance to hide policy violations.": "要求提供结构、澄清、注释、审查和权衡，而不是利用帮助来隐藏政策违规行为。",
