    "Checklist": "清单",
    "Choose a hosted meeting agent when automatic team sharing, admin workspaces, CRM sync, or searchable company meeting archives matter more than a local desktop workflow.": "当自动团队共享、管理工作区、CRM 同步或可搜索的公司会议存档比本地桌面工作流程更重要时，请选择托管会议代理。",
    "Choose an enterprise meeting platform when your organization requires centralized policy controls, SSO, eDiscovery, legal holds, or admin-managed retention.": "当您的组织需要集中策略控制、SSO、电子取证、合法保留或管理员管理的保留时，请选择企业会议平台。",
