    "Choose ExtraBrain when you want a local-first Mac workflow, local Parakeet transcription, local Gemma 4 where installed and compatible, and provider access you control.": "当您需要本地优先的 Mac 工作流程、本地 Parakeet 转录、已安装且兼容的本地 Gemma 4 以及您控制的提供商访问权限时，请选择 ExtraBrain。",
    "Choose ExtraBrain when you want the live workflow on your Mac with explicit provider choices and a clear path to local transcription and local Gemma 4 where installed and compatible.": "当您希望 Mac 上的实时工作流程具有明确的提供商选择以及本地转录和本地 Gemma 4（已安装且兼容）的清晰路径时，请选择 ExtraBrain。",
