    "Cluely is explicitly framed around live meetings, recaps, and in-call answers.": "Cluely 明确围绕实时会议、回顾和通话中的答案进行设计。",
    "Cluely is meeting-answer focused; ExtraBrain covers interviews, meetings, coding, system design, lectures, research, and post-session review.": "Cluely 注重会议答案； ExtraBrain 涵盖采访、会议、编码、系统设计、讲座、研究和会后回顾。",
    "Cluely is publicly framed around meeting assistance and screen-share undetectability. ExtraBrain covers meeting support plus coding, system design, behavioral, lecture, and research workflows.": "Cluely 是围绕会议协助和屏幕共享不可检测性公开构建的。 ExtraBrain 涵盖会议支持以及编码、系统设计、行为、讲座和研究工作流程。",
    "Cluely positions itself as an undetectable AI for meetings with real-time answers and meeting notes. ExtraBrain focuses on local-first Mac interview and meeting workflows with local Parakeet transcription, local Gemma 4 where installed and compatible, and BYO provider control.": "Cluely 将自己定位为无法检测的人工智能会议，提供实时答案和会议记录。 ExtraBrain 专注于本地优先 Mac 面试和会议工作流程，具有本地 Parakeet 转录、本地 Gemma 4（安装并兼容）以及 BYO 提供商控制。",
    "Cluely pricing": "Cluely 定价",
    "Cluely publicly positions itself as an undetectable AI for meetings with real-time answers and meeting notes. ExtraBrain focuses on local-first desktop interview and meeting workflows with local Gemma 4 where installed and compatible and BYO provider control. ExtraBrain is available for Mac today, with Windows and Linux planned.": "Cluely 公开将自己定位为无法检测的人工智能会议，提供实时答案和会议记录。 ExtraBrain 专注于本地优先的桌面面试和会议工作流程，其中安装并兼容本地 Gemma 4 以及 BYO 提供商控制。 ExtraBrain 今天可用于 Mac，并计划提供 Windows 和 Linux。",
    "Cluely says it listens to meetings in real time, gives instant answers, creates meeting notes, does not join meetings as a bot, and offers screen-share invisibility features.": "Cluely 表示，它可以实时收听会议、提供即时答案、创建会议记录、不作为机器人加入会议，并提供屏幕共享隐形功能。",
    "Cluely separates a higher-priced undetectability tier, so compare screen-share needs and plan limits before buying.": "Cluely 分隔了价格较高的不可检测层，因此在购买之前请比较屏幕共享需求和计划限制。",
    "Cluely separates Pro + Undetectability as a higher-priced plan on its pricing page.": "Cluely 在其定价页面上将 Pro + UnDetectability 分离为价格较高的计划。",
    "Cluely undetectability": "Cluely 不可检测性",
