    "Compare": "比较",
    "Compare a career-platform interview copilot against a local-first desktop copilot.": "将职业平台面试副驾驶与本地优先的桌面副驾驶进行比较。",
    "Compare a coding-interview specialist against a broader local-first desktop copilot.": "将编码面试专家与更广泛的本地优先桌面副驾驶进行比较。",
    "Compare a priced subscription/lifetime interview copilot against a free-core local-first Mac app.": "将付费订阅 /lifetime 面试副驾驶与免费核心本地优先 Mac 应用程序进行比较。",
    "Compare an all-in-one interview suite against a local-first desktop live workflow.": "将一体化面试套件与本地优先的桌面实时工作流程进行比较。",
    "Compare an interview assistant with credits/subscriptions against a local-first desktop copilot.": "将具有学分/subscriptions的面试助理与本地优先的桌面副驾驶进行比较。",
    "Compare app pricing": "比较应用定价",
    "Compare approaches": "比较方法",
    "Compare Beyz’s invisible desktop interview suite against ExtraBrain’s local-first Mac copilot.": "将 Beyz 的隐形桌面面试套件与 ExtraBrain 的本地优先 Mac 副驾驶进行比较。",
    "Compare Cluely": "比较 Cluely",
    "Compare coding depth, system design help, pricing, provider control, data flow, platform support, and whether live help is allowed.": "比较编码深度、系统设计帮助、定价、提供商控制、数据流、平台支持以及是否允许实时帮助。",
    "Compare coding depth, system design support, data flow, platform claims, pricing, provider control, support for non-coding workflows, and whether live assistance is allowed in your interview.": "比较编码深度、系统设计支持、数据流、平台声明、定价、提供商控制、对非编码工作流程的支持以及面试中是否允许实时协助。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and Beyz AI for invisible desktop interview help, real-time suggestions, coding, meetings, pricing, platforms, and provider control.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 Beyz AI 以获得隐形桌面面试帮助、实时建议、编码、会议、定价、平台和提供商控制。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and Cluely for live meetings, screen-share invisibility, local Gemma 4, BYO providers, local-first desktop workflows, and pricing models.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 Cluely 的实时会议、屏幕共享隐形、本地 Gemma 4、BYO 提供商、本地优先桌面工作流程和定价模型。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and Cluely for meetings, interviews, screen-share invisibility, local-first workflows, provider control, and pricing.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 Cluely 的会议、采访、屏幕共享隐形、本地优先工作流程、提供商控制和定价。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and Final Round AI for live interview assistance, interview preparation, privacy, local Gemma 4, BYO providers, and macOS desktop workflows.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 Final Round AI 的实时面试协助、面试准备、隐私、本地 Gemma 4、BYO 提供商和 macOS 桌面工作流程。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and Final Round AI for live interview help, interview preparation, mock interviews, desktop workflows, pricing, and provider control.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 Final Round AI 的实时面试帮助、面试准备、模拟面试、桌面工作流程、定价和提供商控制。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and InterviewBee for live interview help, mock interviews, desktop assistant plans, pricing, platform support, and provider control.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 InterviewBee 的实时面试帮助、模拟面试、桌面助理计划、定价、平台支持和提供商控制。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and InterviewCoder for coding interviews, system design, undetectability claims, pricing, Gemma 4, and BYO providers.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 InterviewCoder 的编码面试、系统设计、不可检测性声明、定价、Gemma 4 和 BYO 提供商。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and InterviewCoder for coding interviews, undetectability claims, pricing, local Gemma 4, BYO providers, and local-first desktop workflows.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 InterviewCoder 的编码访谈、不可检测性声明、定价、本地 Gemma 4、BYO 提供商和本地优先桌面工作流程。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and Linkjob AI pricing, interview assistance, coding copilot, quiz assistant, stealth claims, model tiers, and provider control.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 Linkjob AI 定价、面试协助、编码副驾驶、测验助理、隐形声明、模型层和提供商控制。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and LockedIn AI for interview copilot workflows, desktop stealth mode, phone interviews, career tools, pricing, and provider control.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 LockedIn AI 的面试副驾驶工作流程、桌面隐形模式、电话面试、职业工具、定价和提供商控制。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain and ParakeetAI for real-time interview assistance, coding support, privacy claims, credits, subscriptions, lifetime plans, and local-first workflows.": "比较 ExtraBrain 和 ParakeetAI 的实时面试帮助、编码支持、隐私声明、积分、订阅、终身计划和本地优先工作流程。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain Free and Pro for live interview workflows, stealth mode, AI models, providers, interview domains, custom profiles, provider costs, and licensing.": "比较 ExtraBrain 免费和 Pro 的实时面试工作流程、隐形模式、AI 模型、提供商、面试域、自定义配置文件、提供商成本和许可。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain with alternatives": "将 ExtraBrain 与替代方案进行比较",
    "Compare ExtraBrain with Cluely, InterviewCoder, Final Round AI, LockedIn AI, ParakeetAI, Linkjob AI, Beyz AI, and InterviewBee.": "将 ExtraBrain 与 Cluely、InterviewCoder、Final Round AI、LockedIn AI、ParakeetAI、Linkjob AI、Beyz AI 和 InterviewBee 进行比较。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain with Cluely, InterviewCoder, Final Round AI, LockedIn AI, ParakeetAI, Linkjob AI, Beyz AI, InterviewBee, and other AI interview assistants.": "将 ExtraBrain 与 Cluely、InterviewCoder、Final Round AI、LockedIn AI、ParakeetAI、Linkjob AI、Beyz AI、InterviewBee 和其他 AI 面试助手进行比较。",
    "Compare ExtraBrain with live AI interview assistants.": "将 ExtraBrain 与实时 AI 面试助理进行比较。",
