    "Compare Free and Pro": "比较免费和 Pro",
    "Compare InterviewBee’s session-limited paid plans and desktop technical assistant against ExtraBrain’s free-core Mac app.": "将 InterviewBee 的会话限制付费计划和桌面技术助理与 ExtraBrain 的免费核心 Mac 应用程序进行比较。",
    "Compare InterviewCoder": "比较 InterviewCoder",
    "Compare local app storage, vendor cloud storage, team workspaces, provider logs, and export or deletion controls before using sensitive content.": "在使用敏感内容之前，比较本地应用程序存储、供应商云存储、团队工作区、提供商日志以及导出或删除控制。",
    "Compare meeting assistance against ExtraBrain workflows for coding, system design, behavioral interviews, research, lectures, and meetings.": "将会议协助与编码、系统设计、行为访谈、研究、讲座和会议的 ExtraBrain 工作流程进行比较。",
    "Compare meeting-first assistance against a local-first desktop copilot for interviews and meetings.": "将会议优先协助与本地优先桌面副驾驶进行采访和会议进行比较。",
    "Compare the app price, model and transcription billing, usage limits, platform support, privacy path, cancellation terms, and whether you want a bundled hosted service or provider access you control.": "比较应用程序价格、型号和转录计费、使用限制、平台支持、隐私路径、取消条款，以及您是否需要捆绑的托管服务或您控制的提供商访问权限。",
    "Compare the app workflow, model paths, interview domains, and costs together. ExtraBrain Pro changes app controls and reusable workflow behavior; AI provider usage remains separate for both plans.": "比较应用程序工作流程、模型路径、访谈领域和成本。 ExtraBrain Pro 更改应用程序控件和可重用工作流程行为；这两个计划的人工智能提供商的使用仍然是分开的。",
    "Compare what each product says about meeting audio, transcript text, screenshots, uploaded files, notes, and past-meeting history before using sensitive content.": "在使用敏感内容之前，比较每个产品对会议音频、记录文本、屏幕截图、上传的文件、笔记和过去会议历史记录的说明。",
    "Compare whether the tool helps with spoken clarifications, system design follow-ups, debugging discussion, and tradeoff explanations instead of only returning a code answer.": "比较该工具是否有助于口头澄清、系统设计后续、调试讨论和权衡解释，而不是仅返回代码答案。",
    "Compare whether you need broad career workflow support across industries or a desktop assistant for interviews, meetings, lectures, research, and provider-controlled AI.": "比较您是否需要跨行业的广泛职业工作流程支持，或者是否需要用于面试、会议、讲座、研究和提供商控制的人工智能的桌面助手。",
    "Compare workflow scope, platform support, data flow, provider control, whether answers include reasoning, and whether the tool fits the rules of the interview.": "比较工作流程范围、平台支持、数据流、提供商控制、答案是否包含推理以及工具是否符合面试规则。",
