    "Concise framing": "简洁的框架",
    "Configure a second tested provider or local option for quota, outage, or quality issues before high-stakes sessions.": "在高风险会话之前，配置第二个经过测试的提供商或本地选项，以解决配额、中断或质量问题。",
    "Configure a tested fallback so quota, availability, or local hardware limits do not derail a live session.": "配置经过测试的回退，以便配额、可用性或本地硬件限制不会破坏实时会话。",
    "Configure profile behavior such as expanding the window on analysis, analyzing after a region screenshot, and using fuller session context.": "配置配置文件行为，例如扩展分析窗口、区域屏幕截图后进行分析以及使用更完整的会话上下文。",
    "Confirm the release source, asset name, version, checksum availability, and current release notes.": "确认发布源、资产名称、版本、校验和可用性以及当前发行说明。",
    "Confirm whether audio is transcribed on your device, uploaded to a transcription service, or processed by a meeting bot vendor.": "确认音频是否在您的设备上转录、上传到转录服务或由会议机器人供应商处理。",
