    "Depending on setup, ExtraBrain can use live audio, transcript text, screenshots, prompts, generated notes, saved facts, and provider responses.": "根据设置，ExtraBrain 可以使用实时音频、转录文本、屏幕截图、提示、生成的注释、保存的事实和提供商响应。",
