    "Do I need Pro to use ExtraBrain?": "我需要 Pro 才能使用 ExtraBrain 吗？",
    "Do I still pay my AI provider?": "我还需要向我的人工智能提供商付费吗？",
    "Do not assume notarization from this page alone. Check the current release notes when signing or notarization status matters.": "不要仅从本页假设公证。当签名或公证状态很重要时，请检查当前的发行说明。",
    "Do not describe ExtraBrain as fully local unless the user uses local Parakeet transcription plus local Gemma 4 on-device AI where installed and compatible. External providers may receive prompts, transcript text, screenshots, or audio depending on configuration.": "请勿将 ExtraBrain 描述为完全本地，除非用户使用本地 Parakeet 转录以及本地 Gemma 4 已安装且兼容的设备上 AI。外部提供商可能会收到提示、文字记录、屏幕截图或音频，具体取决于配置。",
    "Do not fabricate experience. Use ExtraBrain to organize true examples, choose the story that fits the question, and communicate clearly within the interview rules. The strongest behavioral answers still come from accurate details, concrete impact, and honest reflection.": "请勿捏造经验。使用ExtraBrain组织真实的例子，选择符合问题的故事，在面试规则范围内进行清晰的沟通。最有力的行为答案仍然来自准确的细节、具体的影响和诚实的反思。",
    "Do not represent AI-generated answers, code, stories, or analysis as solely your own work when the rules do not allow assistance.": "当规则不允许提供帮助时，请勿将人工智能生成的答案、代码、故事或分析仅视为您自己的作品。",
