    "Download the latest ExtraBrain macOS release, review Mac compatibility, install steps, checksum notes, signing guidance, and release metadata.": "下载最新的 ExtraBrain macOS 版本，查看 Mac 兼容性、安装步骤、校验和说明、签名指南和版本元数据。",
    "Download, install, launch, and verify ExtraBrain before a live interview or meeting.": "在现场采访或会议之前下载、安装、启动和验证 ExtraBrain。",
    "Early-adopter price with code EARLYBIRD applied.": "应用代码 EARLYBIRD 的早期采用者价格。",
