    "Final Round AI is better aligned when you want mock interviews, preparation workflows, resume context, and post-interview reports in one hosted suite.": "当您想要在一个托管套件中进行模拟面试、准备工作流程、简历背景和面试后报告时，Final Round AI 会更好。",
    "Final Round AI positions itself as an all-in-one interview preparation and live Interview Copilot product. ExtraBrain focuses on local-first Mac live workflows and provider access you control.": "Final Round AI 将自己定位为一款一体化面试准备和现场面试副驾驶产品。 ExtraBrain 专注于本地优先 Mac 实时工作流程和您控制的提供商访问权限。",
    "Final Round AI pricing/product page": "Final Round AI 定价/product 页",
    "Final Round AI publicly describes preparation, live Interview Copilot, and post-interview feedback. ExtraBrain focuses on live desktop context and post-session review, not automated applications or resume tooling.": "Final Round AI 公开描述准备、现场面试副驾驶和面试后反馈。 ExtraBrain 专注于实时桌面环境和会话后审查，而不是自动化应用程序或简历工具。",
    "Final Round AI publicly positions itself around interview preparation and real-time interview help across many roles. ExtraBrain focuses on local-first desktop live workflows with local Gemma 4 where installed and compatible and BYO provider control. ExtraBrain is available for Mac today, with Windows and Linux planned.": "Final Round AI 公开将自己定位为跨多个角色的面试准备和实时面试帮助。 ExtraBrain 专注于本地优先的桌面实时工作流程，其中安装并兼容本地 Gemma 4 以及 BYO 提供商控制。 ExtraBrain 现已适用于 Mac，并计划推出 Windows 和 Linux。",
    "Find out whether raw audio is kept local, sent to a transcription provider, or captured by a meeting bot service.": "了解原始音频是否保留在本地、发送到转录提供商或由会议机器人服务捕获。",
