    "InterviewBee": "InterviewBee",
    "InterviewBee desktop assistant": "InterviewBee 桌面助手",
    "InterviewBee offers live and mock interview plans plus a desktop AI assistant for technical interviews, with Windows available and Mac marked as coming soon. ExtraBrain offers a free local-first Mac app today with BYO provider control.": "InterviewBee 提供现场和模拟面试计划以及用于技术面试的桌面 AI 助手，其中 Windows 可用，Mac 标记为即将推出。 ExtraBrain 今天提供免费的本地优先 Mac 应用程序，并具有 BYO 提供商控制权。",
    "InterviewBee plans include explicit live interview and mock interview session limits.": "InterviewBee 计划包括明确的现场面试和模拟面试会话限制。",
    "InterviewBee plans list live and mock interview session counts, so compare limits against your expected interview volume.": "InterviewBee 计划列出了现场和模拟面试次数，因此请将限制与您预期的面试量进行比较。",
    "InterviewBee pricing": "InterviewBee 定价",
    "InterviewBee pricing lists Free, Starter, Pro, and Champion plans with live interview and mock interview session limits. Its pricing FAQ says default USD prices can update client-side by detected location and supported currency.": "InterviewBee 定价列出了免费、入门、Pro 和冠军计划，并具有现场面试和模拟面试会话限制。其定价常见问题解答称，默认的美元价格可以通过检测到的位置和支持的货币来更新客户端。",
    "InterviewBee says prices may update by location and currency, so verify the checkout shown to your account.": "InterviewBee 表示价格可能会根据地点和货币进行更新，因此请验证您帐户中显示的结账信息。",
    "InterviewBee, ParakeetAI, and Beyz AI": "InterviewBee、ParakeetAI 和 Beyz AI",
    "InterviewBee’s desktop assistant page lists a Windows download and says Mac is coming soon.": "InterviewBee 的桌面助手页面列出了 Windows 下载，并表示 Mac 即将推出。",
    "InterviewCoder": "InterviewCoder",
    "InterviewCoder describes a desktop app for technical interviews, LeetCode, system design, audio support, and undetectability testing across Teams, Zoom, Meet, Chime, Webex, HackerRank, CoderPad, and Codility.": "InterviewCoder 描述了用于技术面试、LeetCode、系统设计、音频支持和跨 Teams 的不可检测性测试、Zoom、Meet、Chime、Webex、HackerRank、CoderPad 和 Codility 的桌面应用程序。",
    "InterviewCoder focuses on technical interviews and daily-tested undetectability claims across interview apps. ExtraBrain focuses on local-first desktop support across coding, system design, behavioral interviews, and meetings.": "InterviewCoder 专注于跨面试应用程序的技术面试和日常测试的不可检测性声明。 ExtraBrain 专注于跨编码、系统设计、行为访谈和会议的本地优先桌面支持。",
    "InterviewCoder homepage": "InterviewCoder 主页",
    "InterviewCoder is built and messaged around technical interview assistance.": "InterviewCoder 是围绕技术面试协助构建和传达的。",
    "InterviewCoder publicly focuses on technical interviews and extensive undetectability features. ExtraBrain focuses on local-first desktop interviews and meetings with local Gemma 4 where installed and compatible and provider access you control. ExtraBrain is available for Mac today, with Windows and Linux planned.": "InterviewCoder 公开关注技术访谈和广泛的不可检测功能。 ExtraBrain 专注于本地优先的桌面面试和与本地 Gemma 4 的会议，其中已安装且兼容且提供商访问权限由您控制。 ExtraBrain 现已适用于 Mac，并计划推出 Windows 和 Linux。",
