    "Is using ExtraBrain in interviews allowed or considered cheating?": "在面试中使用 ExtraBrain 是否允许或被视为作弊？",
    "It can help with live notes, decisions, owners, risks, action items, customer pain points, follow-ups, and post-session summaries.": "它可以帮助记录实时笔记、决策、责任人、风险、行动项目、客户痛点、后续行动和会后总结。",
    "It can keep latency, availability, consistency, cost, privacy, failure modes, rollout constraints, and observability tradeoffs visible.": "它可以保持延迟、可用性、一致性、成本、隐私、故障模式、推出限制和可观察性权衡可见。",
    "It is for candidates, engineers, founders, students, meeting leads, researchers, and teams who need structured live context while staying mindful of privacy and policy boundaries.": "它适用于需要结构化实时环境同时注意隐私和政策边界的候选人、工程师、创始人、学生、会议负责人、研究人员和团队。",
    "Its FAQ describes mobile-optimized browser access and simultaneous desktop/mobile sessions.": "其常见问题解答描述了移动优化的浏览器访问和同步桌面/mobile 会话。",
    "Its homepage lists daily undetectability checks across many interview and meeting apps.": "它的主页列出了许多面试和会议应用程序的每日不可检测性检查。",
    "Its plans explicitly include an Online Quiz Assistant feature.": "它的计划明确包括在线测验助手功能。",
    "Its public pages frame the product around the full interview lifecycle.": "其公共页面围绕整个面试生命周期构建了产品。",
    "Its support center documents phone interview workflows on mobile devices.": "其支持中心记录了移动设备上的电话面试工作流程。",
    "Job-search suite comparison": "求职套件比较",
    "Keep a backup": "保留备份",
    "Keep boundary cases, empty inputs, duplicates, and complexity tradeoffs visible.": "保持边界情况、空输入、重复和复杂性权衡可见。",
    "Keep candidate components, API boundaries, storage choices, queues, caches, and failure modes organized.": "保持候选组件、API 边界、存储选择、队列、缓存和故障模式井井有条。",
    "Keep decisions, risks, owners, blockers, and follow-ups connected to the live conversation.": "让决策、风险、责任人、阻碍因素和后续行动与实时对话保持联系。",
    "Keep external AI billing tied to provider accounts you already manage instead of bundled credits.": "将外部人工智能计费与您已经管理的提供商帐户绑定，而不是捆绑积分。",
    "Keep local transcripts, screenshots, notes, analyses, and saved facts on your Mac unless you delete them or send content to a selected provider.": "将本地记录、屏幕截图、注释、分析和保存的事实保留在您的 Mac 上，除非您删除它们或将内容发送给选定的提供商。",
    "Keep notes nearby": "在附近记笔记",
    "Keep prompts appropriate": "保持提示适当",
    "Keep real examples for leadership, conflict, failure, ownership, ambiguity, collaboration, and impact.": "保留领导力、冲突、失败、所有权、模糊性、协作和影响的真实例子。",
    "Keep relevant projects, lessons, conflicts, and outcomes close while the conversation shifts.": "当谈话发生变化时，保持相关的项目、经验教训、冲突和结果密切相关。",
    "Keep resume, job description, company context, and interviewer follow-ups separate so you can adapt without losing the thread.": "将简历、职位描述、公司背景和面试官的后续情况分开，这样你就可以在不失去线索的情况下进行调整。",
    "Keep scale estimates, bottlenecks, observability, privacy, and rollout risks visible as the interviewer probes deeper.": "当采访者深入探究时，保持规模估计、瓶颈、可观察性、隐私和推出风险可见。",
    "Keep system design tradeoffs visible while you think.": "在您思考时保持系统设计权衡可见。",
    "Keep the live workflow on the user’s Mac whenever possible, including local transcription and local Gemma 4 where installed and compatible.": "尽可能将实时工作流程保留在用户的 Mac 上，包括本地转录和本地 Gemma 4（如果已安装且兼容）。",
    "Keep the setup path simple: install the Mac app, choose local or cloud transcription, choose on-device AI or provider access, and rehearse once before a real interview, meeting, or lecture.": "保持设置流程简单：安装 Mac 应用，选择本地或云端转录，选择端侧 AI 或提供商访问权限，并在真正的面试、会议或课程前演练一次。",
    "Key takeaways": "要点",
    "Know the rules": "了解规则",
