    "Launch": "发射",
    "Launch ExtraBrain and grant required macOS permissions.": "启动 ExtraBrain 并授予所需的 macOS 权限。",
    "Launch the app, confirm settings and permissions, test transcription, verify local Gemma 4 or provider access, and rehearse before using it in an interview or meeting.": "启动应用程序，确认设置和权限，测试转录，验证本地 Gemma 4 或提供商访问权限，并在面试或会议中使用它之前进行排练。",
    "Leadership, conflict, failure, ownership, ambiguity, collaboration, prioritization, and impact stories all benefit from a clear structure.": "领导力、冲突、失败、所有权、模糊性、协作、优先级和影响力故事都受益于清晰的结构。",
    "Let users choose local or external model and transcription providers they trust, including OpenAI, Anthropic, Claude, Codex, Deepgram, and compatible endpoints.": "让用户选择他们信任的本地或外部模型和转录提供商，包括 OpenAI、Anthropic、Claude、Codex、Deepgram 和兼容端点。",
