    "Linkjob AI lists monthly, quarterly, yearly, and lifetime options, so compare renewal terms and cancellation policy before purchase.": "Linkjob AI 列出了每月、每季度、每年和终生选项，因此请在购买前比较续订条款和取消政策。",
    "Linkjob AI pricing": "Linkjob AI 定价",
    "Linkjob AI pricing describes real-time interview assistant, AI mock interview practice, coding copilot, online quiz assistant, smart screenshot, custom AI response, support, model tiers, and stealth mode.": "Linkjob AI 定价描述了实时面试助手、AI 模拟面试练习、编码副驾驶、在线测验助手、智能截图、自定义 AI 响应、支持、模型层和隐身模式。",
    "Linkjob AI publishes plan prices for a free trial, monthly, quarterly, yearly, and lifetime access with real-time interview, coding copilot, quiz assistant, smart screenshot, and stealth mode features. ExtraBrain keeps the core Mac app free, offers Pro at $9.99/month ($6.99 Founder), $79/year, or $149 Lifetime, and separates external provider billing.": "Linkjob AI 发布免费试用、每月、每季度、每年和终身访问的计划价格，包括实时采访、编码副驾驶、测验助手、智能屏幕截图和隐身模式功能。 ExtraBrain 保持核心 Mac 应用程序免费，在 $9.99/month（$6.99 创始人）、$79/year 或 $149 终身提供 Pro，并分离外部提供商计费。",
