    "LockedIn AI includes resume, cover letter, LinkedIn, job tracking, and career planning workflows.": "LockedIn AI 包括简历、求职信、LinkedIn、工作跟踪和职业规划工作流程。",
    "LockedIn AI includes resume, LinkedIn, job tracking, and related tools; ExtraBrain is narrower and focused on live desktop context.": "LockedIn AI 包括简历、LinkedIn、工作跟踪和相关工具； ExtraBrain 范围更窄，专注于实时桌面环境。",
    "LockedIn AI positions itself as an interview copilot and career platform with web, desktop, phone interview, coding, and job-search tools. ExtraBrain focuses on a local-first Mac desktop workflow for interviews and meetings.": "LockedIn AI 将自己定位为面试副驾驶和职业平台，提供网络、桌面、电话面试、编码和求职工具。 ExtraBrain 专注于用于面试和会议的本地优先 Mac 桌面工作流程。",
    "LockedIn AI pricing": "LockedIn AI 定价",
    "LockedIn AI support": "LockedIn AI 支持",
    "LockedIn AI support describes real-time interview assistance, web app modes, desktop stealth mode, phone interviews, coding screenshots, resume and job-search tools, and career planning features.": "LockedIn AI 支持描述了实时面试帮助、网络应用程序模式、桌面隐形模式、电话面试、编码屏幕截图、简历和求职工具以及职业规划功能。",
    "Look for support that explains latency, availability, consistency, privacy, cost, rollout, and operations tradeoffs instead of only naming components.": "寻求能够解释延迟、可用性、一致性、隐私、成本、部署和运营权衡的支持，而不仅仅是命名组件。",
    "Mac Apple Silicon, Mac Intel, Windows x64 downloads listed": "列出了 Mac Apple Silicon、Mac Intel、Windows x64 下载",
