    "macOS on Apple Silicon or Intel Mac; local Gemma 4 requires installation and compatible hardware": "Apple Silicon 或 Intel 上的 macOS Mac；本地 Gemma 4 需要安装和兼容的硬件",
    "Make policy boundaries, privacy tradeoffs, interview expectations, workplace rules, and external provider data flow visible before high-stakes sessions.": "在高风险会议之前让政策边界、隐私权衡、面试期望、工作场所规则和外部提供商数据流可见。",
