    "Otter-style tools are usually team meeting agents and transcription workspaces. ExtraBrain focuses on a desktop copilot that can support meetings and interviews without joining the call as a bot.": "Otter 风格的工具通常是团队会议代理和转录工作区。 ExtraBrain 专注于桌面副驾驶，可以支持会议和采访，而无需作为机器人加入通话。",
