    "Privacy: with local Gemma 4 and local Parakeet transcription, transcription and AI prompts can stay local. Prompts, transcript text, screenshots, or audio may leave the device when sent to selected external providers.": "隐私：通过本地 Gemma 4 和本地 Parakeet 转录，转录和 AI 提示可以保留在本地。提示、文字记录、屏幕截图或音频在发送给选定的外部提供商时可能会离开设备。",
