    "Pro adds app workflow features, not bundled AI credits.": "Pro 添加应用程序工作流程功能，而不是捆绑 AI 积分。",
    "Pro adds custom profiles, reusable prompt guidance, profile-specific workflow controls, richer history, summaries, premium model controls where enabled, and advanced workflow controls.": "Pro 添加了自定义配置文件、可重复使用的提示指导、特定于配置文件的工作流程控制、更丰富的历史记录、摘要、启用的高级模型控制以及高级工作流程控制。",
    "Pro can preserve reusable prompts for scale, tradeoffs, APIs, data modeling, and follow-up structure.": "Pro 可以保留有关规模、权衡、API、数据建模和后续结构的可重用提示。",
    "Pro helps recurring meeting workflows reuse note, risk, decision, and follow-up preferences.": "Pro 帮助定期会议工作流程重用注释、风险、决策和后续首选项。",
    "Pro is better when repeated sessions need saved facts, summaries, and review controls.": "当重复会话需要保存事实、摘要和审查控制时，Pro 会更好。",
