    "You specifically want Cluely’s meeting-focused product, pricing model, App Store distribution, and its own bundled real-time meeting assistant experience.": "您特别想要 Cluely 以会议为中心的产品、定价模型、App Store 发行版以及其自己捆绑的实时会议助理体验。",
    "You want a broader interview-preparation suite with resume, practice, and job-search oriented features in addition to live interview help.": "除了现场面试帮助之外，您还需要更广泛的面试准备套件，其中包括简历、练习和求职导向的功能。",
    "You want a desktop app with local-first session context and privacy documentation. ExtraBrain is available for Mac today.": "您需要一个具有本地优先会话上下文和隐私文档的桌面应用程序。 ExtraBrain 今天可用于 Mac。",
    "You want a free core app, optional $9.99/month ($6.99 Founder), $79/year, or $149 Lifetime Pro controls, and separate provider billing.": "您需要一个免费的核心应用程序、可选的 $9.99/month（$6.99 创始人）、$79/year 或 $149 终身 Pro 控件以及单独的提供商计费。",
