    "You want local Gemma 4 on-device AI where installed and compatible, or OpenAI, Anthropic, Claude, Codex, or custom provider access you control.": "您需要安装且兼容的本地 Gemma 4 设备上 AI，或 OpenAI、Anthropic、Claude、Codex 或您控制的自定义提供商访问权限。",
